usage: agentsync [-h] [--data-dir DATA_DIR]
                 {mcp,plan,plan-retry,usage,model-usage,owner,relay-status,relay-reconcile,serve,demo,mock-workflow,workflow}
                 ...

positional arguments:
  {mcp,plan,plan-retry,usage,model-usage,owner,relay-status,relay-reconcile,serve,demo,mock-workflow,workflow}
    mcp                 Run official MCP stdio server
    plan                Print offline dispatch advice from bounded stdin JSON
    plan-retry          Print offline retry advice from bounded stdin JSON
    usage               Summarize a bounded stdin usage checkpoint offline
    model-usage         Summarize a bounded stdin model meter snapshot
    owner               Owner operation; read credentials and payload JSON
                        from stdin
    relay-status        Inspect a local relay journal with project owner
                        credentials on stdin
    relay-reconcile     Reconcile one saved local wave using owner and session
                        credentials
    serve               Run authenticated loopback HTTP server
    demo                Run two mock agents against an explicit local database
    mock-workflow       Run a disposable Mock task graph from bounded stdin
                        JSON
    workflow            Operate an owner-only durable Mock workflow

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Absolute local state directory
